[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3060.63, "timestamp": "00:51:00", "text": "想法，你创造了一个全新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3064.03, "timestamp": "00:51:04", "text": "从中得出的独特想法，这远不止于此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3066.829, "timestamp": "00:51:06", "text": "更凉爽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3070.23, "timestamp": "00:51:10", "text": "不。是的。我喜欢这个。这就是为什么我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3073.15, "timestamp": "00:51:13", "text": "我觉得每当我看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3075.67, "timestamp": "00:51:15", "text": "朋友们合作完成的作品，或者如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3079.75, "timestamp": "00:51:19", "text": "他们正在举办活动什么的，嗯，我有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3083.51, "timestamp": "00:51:23", "text": "仔细看看，就像……观察"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3084.092, "timestamp": "00:51:24", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "uk I was listening all of these while playing bg in background"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3086.91, "timestamp": "00:51:26", "text": "是啊，他们真的在做这件事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3089.19, "timestamp": "00:51:29", "text": "一切都像我知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3091.43, "timestamp": "00:51:31", "text": "现实生活中他们忙得不可开交，不得不这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3094.309, "timestamp": "00:51:34", "text": "确保合作顺利进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3096.349, "timestamp": "00:51:36", "text": "因为这是他们的第一份工作，所以一切都得从头开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3099.75, "timestamp": "00:51:39", "text": "等等，对吧？所以我毫不犹豫地告诉你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3102.79, "timestamp": "00:51:42", "text": "你知道，如果我想，我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3108.23, "timestamp": "00:51:48", "text": "就这么闲坐着，什么也不做，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3111.91, "timestamp": "00:51:51", "text": "嗯，就像以客人的身份一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3114.549, "timestamp": "00:51:54", "text": "就像是，合作方会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3116.79, "timestamp": "00:51:56", "text": "合作主持人将负责